### Check the app is running
GET http://localhost:8080/api/status

### Simple: find amount and interest (slide example 1) -> interest 1120, amount 9120
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "AMOUNT",
  "principal": 8000,
  "rate": 7,
  "time": 2,
  "unit": 1
}

### Simple: time given in days (slide example 3) -> interest about 427.78
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "AMOUNT",
  "principal": 10000,
  "rate": 10,
  "time": 154,
  "unit": 4
}

### Simple: find principal, knowing the interest -> principal 8000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "PRINCIPAL",
  "known": "INTEREST",
  "interest": 1120,
  "rate": 7,
  "time": 2,
  "unit": 1
}

### Simple: find rate, knowing the amount -> rate 7
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "RATE",
  "known": "AMOUNT",
  "principal": 8000,
  "amount": 9120,
  "time": 2,
  "unit": 1
}

### Simple: find time, knowing the interest -> 2 years
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "TIME",
  "known": "INTEREST",
  "principal": 8000,
  "rate": 7,
  "interest": 1120
}

### Compound: find amount, interest added quarterly, 180 days -> amount 10506.25, interest 506.25
POST http://localhost:8080/api/compound
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "AMOUNT",
  "principal": 10000,
  "rate": 10,
  "time": 180,
  "unit": 4,
  "timesPerYear": 4
}

### Compound: find time -> 0.5 years
POST http://localhost:8080/api/compound
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "find": "TIME",
  "principal": 10000,
  "amount": 10506.25,
  "rate": 10,
  "timesPerYear": 4
}
